sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Front Desk
    participant PS as PatientsService
    participant DB as Postgres (tenant)
    participant Num as Counter/Numbering
    participant Audit as AuditService

    F->>PS: Create patient (demographics, contacts)
    PS->>Num: nextPatientSequence(tx, orgId)
    Num-->>PS: seq
    PS->>PS: formatPatientNumber(seq) -> PAT-YYYY-NNNNNN
    PS->>DB: Create Patient with patientNumber, orgId
    PS->>DB: Create related records as needed (guardians/consents)
    PS->>Audit: audit patient.created
    PS-->>F: Patient created
    Note over PS: Org-scoped by tenant extension; branch context applied if needed
    Note over Num: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE on counters
